<title>USA: Signet Banking Corp Q3 shr drops to $0.49.</title>
<headline>Signet Banking Corp Q3 shr drops to $0.49.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.49		    $0.50</p>
<p> Net		 29,600		   30,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  60,700		   60,100</p>
<p>(Data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net charge-offs for the quarter were $17.0 million, or 1.15 percent of average loans. At the end of the quarter, the allowance for loan losses was $128.5 million and was equal to 441 percent of non-performing loans and 2.08 percent of loans outstanding.</p>
<p>Company did not provide nine-month results.</p>
</text>
